warning[autocast_used]: `xx` leaves the target type to the context (`s64` to `u8`)
  --> tests/lint/autocast_used/bad.jai:4:17
   |
 4 |     small: u8 = xx big;
   |                 ^^
   |
help: write `cast(u8)` to say so
   |
 4 ~     small: u8 = cast(u8) big;
   |

warning[autocast_used]: `xx` leaves the target type to the context (`s64` to `u8`)
  --> tests/lint/autocast_used/bad.jai:7:13
   |
 7 |     other = xx big;
   |             ^^
   |
help: write `cast(u8)` to say so
   |
 7 ~     other = cast(u8) big;
   |

warning[autocast_used]: `xx` leaves the target type to the context (`s64` to `u8`)
  --> tests/lint/autocast_used/bad.jai:9:25
   |
 9 |     if small > 3 return xx (big + 1);
   |                         ^^
   |
help: write `cast(u8)` to say so
   |
 9 ~     if small > 3 return cast(u8) (big + 1);
   |
